[00:04.92]Smile.
[00:08.63]This won’t hurt.
[00:10.66]You asked for this.
[00:12.30]I know what you’re thinking
[00:13.79]I’ve heard it before
[00:15.05]You want the shortcut
[00:16.39]You want a little more
[00:17.70]I sell it in mirrors
[00:18.96]I wrap it in light
[00:20.21]Safe little answers
[00:21.51]That feel just right
[00:23.02]They call me fake
[00:24.43]Like that’s an insult
[00:25.69]Baby, I survive
[00:27.09]I know the result
[00:28.59]Say it slower
[00:30.04]Say it sweet
[00:31.26]Truth goes down
[00:32.11]When it’s easy to eat
[00:34.10]Play nice
[00:34.76]Stay pretty
[00:35.41]Don’t shake the glass
[00:36.77]Don’t ask too many questions
[00:39.43]Play nice
[00:40.08]Stay ready
[00:40.77]If you want a place
[00:42.13]Learn the rules
[00:43.34]Learn the lesson
[00:44.97]Play nice
[00:49.89]Smile wider
[00:51.68]This is how you win
[00:53.12]Without getting dirty
[00:54.78]♫
[00:59.60]You think control looks ugly
[01:01.19]You think it wears a mask
[01:02.31]But power loves good lighting
[01:03.48]And a question you won’t ask
[01:04.90]I don’t raise my voice
[01:06.16]I don’t need to
[01:07.45]I let the silence
[01:08.28]Do what it’s told to
[01:09.81]Everybody wants the spotlight
[01:11.14]Nobody wants the cost
[01:12.45]I just explain the terms
[01:13.57]Before you get lost
[01:16.56]You call it fear
[01:17.90]I call it structure
[01:19.11]You call it cold
[01:20.28]I call it culture
[01:27.39]Play nice
[01:28.09]Stay quiet
[01:29.09]If it hurts
[01:30.03]You’re doing it right
[01:32.68]Play nice
[01:33.43]Stay shiny
[01:34.18]If you bend a little
[01:35.50]You’ll survive the night
[01:38.25]Play nice
[01:38.77]Be grateful
[01:39.75]This is how you stay
[01:43.64]Alive inside the frame
[01:51.88]I never said I cared
[01:55.48]I said I understood
[01:56.98]There’s a difference
[01:58.09]You should learn it
[01:59.10]If you could
[02:01.39]I don’t break dolls
[02:03.29]I replace them
[02:04.83]That’s mercy
[02:06.19]In a better dress
[02:11.72]Look at me
[02:12.33]Still standing
[02:13.32]Still chosen
[02:15.18]Still clean
[02:16.01]You hate me
[02:16.59]Because it works
[02:18.03]Play nice
[02:18.71]Stay useful
[02:19.46]You’ll thank me
[02:20.35]In the end
[02:23.52]Play nice
[02:24.08]Stay neutral
[02:24.83]This is how
[02:25.39]You keep your friends
[02:28.65]Stay nice
[02:29.46]Stay breathing
[02:30.46]This isn’t cruelty
[02:34.02]It’s design
[02:42.51]If you’re still here
[02:43.42]You’re doing great.
[02:44.51]♫
[02:48.21]Smile.
[02:49.12]♫
[02:52.47]We’re watching.
